{"duration_api_ms":6846,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a8e08a87-da95-43cd-967a-856805b324bd","total_cost_usd":0.013879899999999999,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":713,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":395,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":14},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":713,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":395,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":713,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":713},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1279,"outputTokens":280,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.00026789999999999995,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":256,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":395,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":713,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.013611999999999999,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":14,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":713,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**No.** In a standard '40 Act ETF, the fund is a separate legal entity, usually a series of a trust or corporation. It owns the portfolio, not the adviser. The assets sit with an independent custodian under Section 17(f) and Rule 17f-2. Shareholders own the fund, not claims on the sponsor. The sponsor's creditors therefore have no claim on fund assets, and the sponsor's bankruptcy does not by itself cancel or impair the shares.\n\n**Separation is not a guaranteed outcome, though.** In practice:\n\n- **Disruption:** The board must find a new adviser (interim contracts under Rule 15a-4) or liquidate the fund. Liquidation means a taxable cash-out at NAV, possibly at a bad time.\n- **Trading friction:** Spreads may widen, premiums or discounts may appear, and APs may step back.\n- **Costs:** Fee waivers may end, and transition or legal costs may fall on the fund.\n- **Other failures:** Custodian failure, fraud, operational errors or a lapsed index license are separate risks.\n- **Market losses:** Normal investment losses still apply.","ttft_ms":1552,"type":"result","duration_ms":5418,"uuid":"85f0f3ac-e62d-4884-8c89-982fb356e7f3","ttft_stream_ms":1505,"time_to_request_ms":71,"first_content_frame_ms":1505,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
